# techneissa's fork (FORK.md): append-only lists that feature branches add lines to. `union` keeps both
# sides' new lines instead of a clash in a local `git merge`. GitHub's pull request merge ignores it, so feature
# branches leave these files to the batch on `custom` (FORK.md step 6).
fork/features.md merge=union
fork/known-failures.txt merge=union
# The craft-i18n pin: CI and the build read it as one SHA, so it stays LF everywhere (readers trim it too).
craft-i18n.rev text eol=lf
